Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.96,DCMain,MOENA,0,0,0,,{\be1}!أفلتني
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.30,DCMain,MOENA,0,0,0,,{\be1}!جنازة جدتي غدًا
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.41,DCMain,MOENA,0,0,0,,{\be1}!لا وقت لديّ
