Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:41.63,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,{\be1}أجل، حب
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:45.59,DCMain,KAZUHA,0,0,0,,{\be1}!كفى يا [ران]
